# Vendored third-party sources stay byte-identical to upstream.
#
# miniaudio.h must be ignored rather than merely left alone: clang-format's
# preprocessor-branch exploration blows up combinatorially on it (nested
# #if/#elif/#else inside function bodies and asm operand lists), reaching
# ~49 GB RSS and getting OOM-killed -- which takes the whole machine down,
# not just the format run.
old-msga/third_party/**

# Vendored (trimmed) stb and the tables src/tools/icons.py and src/tools/i18n.py
# generate (ctest i18n_up_to_date compares the latter byte for byte).
src/third_party/**
src/gfx/icons_generated.*
src/app/i18n/languages_generated.cpp
